message: If you use this software or the checks it implements, please cite it.
title: metabench and the benchmark-validity studies for metabolic reaction activity scoring
abstract: >-
  Reusable checks for benchmarks whose labels are shared across samples, together with
  the code and results of two studies that apply them to transcriptome-based metabolic
  reaction activity scoring on Recon3D.
